They're the meat in our sandwiches and slices of American pop culture.

3
00:00:08,321 --> 00:00:14,440
They're the source of long-held secrets and the inspiration from mile-high masterpieces.

4
00:00:14,441 --> 00:00:17,440
Delectable and dodgy.

5
