406
00:29:43,320 --> 00:29:51,280
Before every shift, they must don freshly laundered smocks and sanitize their hands to reduce the risk of transporting bacteria into the plant.

407
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:53,500
This is where the process begins.

408
00:29:55,700 --> 00:29:58,040
It begins with a pass through the boot scrubber.

409
00:29:58,041 --> 00:30:00,600
