00:30:22,980 --> 00:30:25,640
The turkey carcasses are carved into sections.

416
00:30:25,641 --> 00:30:29,640
breasts head down the final trim line.

417
00:30:29,641 --> 00:30:36,200
We'll remove any connective tissue, blood, or bruising from the wing joint area of the

418
00:30:36,201 --> 00:30:37,200
