419
00:30:37,201 --> 00:30:40,140
We then use a process called peeler rollers.

420
00:30:40,141 --> 00:30:43,960
We simply roll the breast lobe on the rollers.

421
00:30:43,961 --> 00:30:49,800
That helps remove any excess fat, skin, and again break up any connective tissue that

422
00:30:49,801 --> 00:30:53,960
might cause toughness in the product later on during consumption.

423
00:30:53,961 --> 00:31:01,460
The breast load then continues to travel down the line to the final trim station.

