438
00:32:13,580 --> 00:32:20,120
When I do my inspection in here, I look for temperatures of the meat coming from the coolers in here.

439
00:32:20,121 --> 00:32:23,540
I verify that the brine is at the right temperature.

440
00:32:24,060 --> 00:32:26,660
