00:32:45,800 --> 00:32:48,820
Inside the massager, the turkeys tumble for about three hours.

447
00:32:49,900 --> 00:32:52,920
As they bang along, the brine is evenly distributed through the meat.

448
00:32:54,300 --> 00:32:58,060
Simultaneously, the salt draws the meat's natural proteins to the outer surface.

449
00:32:59,100 --> 00:33:03,960
As you can see, the meat has a very tacky, a very sticky look to it,

450
00:33:03,961 --> 00:33:06,760
a waxy appearance, that's what you look for.

451
00:33:07,540 --> 00:33:10,700
That tackiness is a sign that you've done a good job

452
00:33:10,701 --> 00:33:13,600
at extracting protein, again, through vacuum

453
00:33:13,601 --> 00:33:16,580
and through mechanical action of massage.

454
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:19,840
The sticky breasts are then weighed to spec

455
00:33:19,841 --> 00:33:23,420
and placed two to four at a time inside a plastic pocket.

